<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Hold Off — The pause before you send</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Hold Off helps you pause before impulsive messages so your relationships get your best self.">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f8fafc;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --text: #0f172a;
      --muted: #475569;
      --line: #dbe4ee;
      --accent: #6366f1;
      --accent-soft: #e0e7ff;
      --radius: 16px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .shell {
      max-width: 1040px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 22px 0;
    }

    .brand {
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #eef2ff, #ffffff 45%);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 72px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem);
      line-height: 1.12;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .hero p {
      margin: 18px auto 0;
      max-width: 620px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .cta-row {
      margin-top: 30px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--text);
      border-color: var(--line);
    }

    section {
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    .copy {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .copy h2 {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .copy p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .grid {
      margin-top: 24px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 18px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .cta {
      margin: 14px 0 52px;
      background: var(--accent-soft);
      border: 1px solid #c7d2fe;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 34px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta h2 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.7rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .cta p {
      margin: 12px auto 0;
      max-width: 560px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 24px 0 34px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    footer a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 8px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero { padding: 56px 22px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .nav { flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
      .nav-links { flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="nav">
      <a href="/" class="brand">Hold Off</a>
      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#features">Benefits</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero" id="top">
        <h1>The pause between feeling and sending.</h1>
        <p>Hold Off helps you slow down before impulsive texts, so you can respond with clarity, not panic.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a href="/filter" class="btn btn-primary">Try Hold Off</a>
          <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-secondary">Create free account</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="about">
        <div class="copy">
          <h2>A calmer way to communicate</h2>
          <p>When emotions spike, a tiny pause can protect your relationships. Hold Off gives you that pause with grounded, practical support before you press send.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="features">
        <div class="copy">
          <h2>Simple support, right when you need it</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Pause-first flow</h3>
            <p>Capture the message, take a breath, and choose your response intentionally.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Clear rewrites</h3>
            <p>Get suggestions that stay true to your voice while lowering emotional heat.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Pattern awareness</h3>
            <p>Spot recurring texting loops so each conversation gets healthier over time.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cta" id="contact">
        <h2>Ready to build your pause?</h2>
        <p>Questions, partnerships, or press: email <a href="mailto:holdoff@shouldiholdoff.live">holdoff@shouldiholdoff.live</a>. Want to start now? Open the app and take your first pause.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a href="/filter" class="btn btn-primary">Open Hold Off</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>&copy; 2026 Hold Off</p>
      <p>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
      </p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
